        "content": "<div style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#c7d0d9;border-left:3px solid #B77D34;background:rgba(183,125,52,0.07)\"><b style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Source: LLDPq Plane-B optical sweep</b> (<code>lldpq_eth_optical_*</code>, <code>eth_optical_voltage_volts</code>, <code>eth_transceiver_info</code> via the <code>eth-prometheus</code> collector). <b>That collector is currently stopped</b>, so the panels on this board are idle; every panel is preserved unchanged and repopulates as soon as it restarts. Module temperature, supply voltage and symbol errors are exported; per-lane RX/TX optical power in dBm is not exported by the LLDPq bridge.<br><b style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Ethernet boards:</b> <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-l2-eth-fabric\">Ethernet area home</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-pfc-ecn\">Congestion signalling</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-jitter-latency\">Queueing delay</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-optical\">Optical DOM</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-fabric-overview\">Tray NIC health</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-home\">NVIS Home</a></div>",
